24","title":"Tata Power shifted from coal-based power to green energy, renewables, and EV charging, focusing on sustainability.\nIRCTC evolved from catering to a digital monopoly for ticket booking; MSTC moved from scrap trading to e-auction tech, and Bajaj Finance became a fintech leader.","summary":"Tata Power shifted from coal-based power to green energy, renewables, and EV charging, focusing on sustainability.\nIRCTC evolved from catering to a digital monopoly for ticket booking; MSTC moved from scrap trading to e-auction tech, and Bajaj Finance became a fintech leader.","url":"https://tradebrains.in/tata-power-and-3-other-stocks-that-completely-changed-their-business-model-and-won/","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2025-12-03T09:36:58","source":"Trade Brains"}]}]